  "description": "An application submitted under Section 96a of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990 for a non-material amendment to planning permission DC/14/086514 dated 10 November 2014 for the change of use of 7 live/work units at the ground floor of the Distillery Crescent, 2 Seager Place SE8 (units B,C,D,E,F,G,& H) to form 7no. self-contained 2-bedroom residential units and conversion and use of an approved restaurant in the ground floor of the Distillery Crescent (unit A), together with approved retail uses at ground floor level in the Distillery Tower (south) 1, Mill Lane SE8 as hotel accommodation together with the creation of two new self-contained residential units in the first floor of the Distillery Tower to change the development description so that it is unspecific regarding the number of units that are permitted.",
